# Extra skill packs. External `pack` entries are cloned at install into the
# OpenClaw workspace skills root on the state volume. Local `router` entries
# are copied from this repo, and are also baked into the image. The
# cybersecurity pack stays in cybersecurity-skills.pin.
# Playbook text is not relicensed. Each external pack keeps its upstream license.
#
# router <dir under skills/>   copied from this repo into the OpenClaw home
# pack <id>
# repo <git url>
# sha <full commit>
# dest <path under skills/>
# layout flat|grouped          grouped nests children under the include parent
# include <path in the checkout>
# exclude <child directory name>
# doc <file at checkout root copied next to the playbooks>

router skill-packs
router engineering-pack
router product-pack
router marketing-pack
router sales-pack
router customer-success-pack
router finance-pack
router design-pack
router documents
router academic-research-pack
router software-delivery-pack
router minimal-code-pack
router token-efficient-agenting-pack
router action-first-communication-pack
router code-graph-pack
router codebase-knowledge-pack
router recent-research-pack
router agent-skill-catalog-pack
router scientific-research-pack
router diagram-design-pack
router target-workspace
router plow-latch

pack engineering-matt
repo https://github.com/mattpocock/skills.git
sha c55ee46073ed923f86ce59a5eb3b6d895095d1b7
